    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord!</h1><p><br>Remember to add to your wishlist!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1670896761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/0e27599eb29ef17129bcad1470acf99d.avif?t=1670896761\" /></span><br><br>Seas of strife is an open world action adventure strategy game that takes place in a fantasy themed world beset by water. You as a player can carve out your own story in this ocean of cultural rivalries, warring kingdoms, bloodthirsty pirates, pious zealots and opportunistic traders. <br><br>Create and develop your characters skills to suit your playstyle as you plunder and trade your way to untold riches, shaping the world for better or for worse around you as you go. Raise a fleet then hire skilled crew and captains to wage large scale 3rd person fleet battles to determine the fate of entire kingdoms!<br><br>Explore new oceans never seen before! Meet exotic strange minor factions who are just as likely to eat you than greet you! Fight their enemies to gain newfound allies!<br><br>Or do absolutely none of that, and just go fishing! It's entirely up to you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.poster.avif?t=1670896761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.webm?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.mp4?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/ea13d5371da7f62460e1338a45849478.avif?t=1670896761\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play your way! Be a pirate, trader, privateer, adventurer or conqueror! </li><li>Pick from a pool of 18 unique ships to create your fleet!</li><li>Blast your enemies out of the water with 30 unique weapons!</li><li>Crew your ships and expand your raiding party with your pick from 60 different sailors and soldiers! </li><li>Join one of 6 major fantasy themed factions of humans, dwarves, orcs or elves... or create your own and destroy them all!</li><li>Discover and interact with 20+ strange and mysterious minor factions!</li><li>Trade exotic goods across the entire ocean! Shaping how wars play out through the power of commerce! (But watch out for pirates!)</li><li>Complete quests for that big payday!</li><li>Explore outside the known borders into the ever changing procedurally generated unknown seas!</li><li>Chase down the best fishing spot in the whole ocean!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.poster.avif?t=1670896761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.webm?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.mp4?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/0e27599eb29ef17129bcad1470acf99d.avif?t=1670896761\" /></span><br><br>Seas of strife is an open world action adventure strategy game that takes place in a fantasy themed world beset by water. You as a player can carve out your own story in this ocean of cultural rivalries, warring kingdoms, bloodthirsty pirates, pious zealots and opportunistic traders. <br><br>Create and develop your characters skills to suit your playstyle as you plunder and trade your way to untold riches, shaping the world for better or for worse around you as you go. Raise a fleet then hire skilled crew and captains to wage large scale 3rd person fleet battles to determine the fate of entire kingdoms!<br><br>Explore new oceans never seen before! Meet exotic strange minor factions who are just as likely to eat you than greet you! Fight their enemies to gain newfound allies!<br><br>Or do absolutely none of that, and just go fishing! It's entirely up to you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.poster.avif?t=1670896761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.webm?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/49509d9f51200052b5e803ec96908dec.mp4?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/ea13d5371da7f62460e1338a45849478.avif?t=1670896761\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play your way! Be a pirate, trader, privateer, adventurer or conqueror! </li><li>Pick from a pool of 18 unique ships to create your fleet!</li><li>Blast your enemies out of the water with 30 unique weapons!</li><li>Crew your ships and expand your raiding party with your pick from 60 different sailors and soldiers! </li><li>Join one of 6 major fantasy themed factions of humans, dwarves, orcs or elves... or create your own and destroy them all!</li><li>Discover and interact with 20+ strange and mysterious minor factions!</li><li>Trade exotic goods across the entire ocean! Shaping how wars play out through the power of commerce! (But watch out for pirates!)</li><li>Complete quests for that big payday!</li><li>Explore outside the known borders into the ever changing procedurally generated unknown seas!</li><li>Chase down the best fishing spot in the whole ocean!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.poster.avif?t=1670896761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.webm?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244010/extras/60532eb4beab9c82e1cde26362d43f9b.mp4?t=1670896761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "In a world dominated by a vast uncaring sea, greedy pirates stalk the open water and fantastical kingdoms wage devastating wars for what little land exists. It's time for you to assemble your fleet, set sail and plunder, trade or conquer your way towards your destiny!",
